<title>BAHRAIN: NBB approves 10mln dinar dividend for 96.</title>
<headline>NBB approves 10mln dinar dividend for 96.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Bank of Bahrain (NBB) said its shareholders had approved a 10 million dinar dividend for 1996.</p>
<p>It paid a nine million dinar dividend for 1995.</p>
<p>Last month NBB, the island's biggest commercial bank, announced that net profit rose 31 percent to 13.6 million dinars in 1996 from 10.4 million dinars the previous year.</p>
<p>A bank statement said its capital adequacy ratio was 24.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom - 973-524424.</p>
</text>
